  "description": "Listed building consent for internal reconfiguration of existing ground floor units Nos. 6-10 to provide four self-contained units with new accessible entrance to front elevation of unit No. 8, new fire exit at the rear of unit No. 10.&nbsp;Refurbishment works to include: General: Meter upgrades &amp; WiFi Upgrade. • Unit 6 - extend demise to include WC. Construct wall to between unit 7. • Unit 7 - Construct wall to between unit 8. • Unit 8-9 - Form new entrance doors to match units 6&amp;7 with internal ramp to create level street access. • Unit 10 - Remove steps to unit 8 and make good, block up lift, form partition to separate from basement. Remove lightweight partitions to enlarge café space. • To Basement - Form new rear access door to basement and infill existing opening.",
